  <section id="summary">
    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <div class="card reveal">
      <p>
        Senior DevOps &amp; Platform Engineer with nearly 7 years of experience architecting and scaling
        cloud-native platforms across GCP, AWS, and Azure. Proven track record in Platform Engineering,
        Kubernetes, Infrastructure as Code, and DevSecOps — delivering self-service cloud platforms,
        standardized landing zones, and automated deployment frameworks that accelerate developer
        productivity and operational efficiency.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Skilled in driving cloud transformation using Terraform, GitOps, CI/CD, and cloud governance
        frameworks to improve deployment velocity, strengthen security posture, and increase
        infrastructure reliability. Builds observability-driven platforms with advanced monitoring,
        logging, and incident management to ensure high availability for mission-critical workloads.
        Also brings hands-on MLOps and AI Infrastructure experience — model serving, model lifecycle
        management, and Kubernetes-based ML platforms — as a secondary, supporting skill set.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

