  <section id="experience">
    <h2>Experience</h2>

    <details class="role-card reveal" open>
      <summary>
        <span><span class="role-title">DevOps Engineer</span> <span class="role-company">— Capgemini, Noida</span></span>
        <span class="role-dates">Sep 2024 – Present <span class="chevron">▸</span></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="role-body">
        <ul>
          <li>Designed and governed enterprise-scale GCP landing zones using Shared VPC architecture, project hierarchies, remote state management, IAM governance, and policy-as-code controls.</li>
          <li>Built and standardized reusable Terraform Enterprise modules for networking, IAM, Kubernetes, monitoring, logging, load balancing, and security services — reducing infrastructure provisioning effort by 70%.</li>
          <li>Enabled self-service infrastructure delivery by integrating Terraform Enterprise with Git-based CI/CD, Harness, Jira, and ServiceNow, streamlining change management.</li>
          <li>Administered production-grade GKE environments — node pool lifecycle, cluster upgrades, autoscaling — strengthening reliability and service availability.</li>
          <li>Drove cloud cost optimization across GCP, achieving a 20% reduction in cloud spend through governance, right-sizing, and capacity planning.</li>
          <li>Enhanced security and observability with Cloud Armor WAF policies, rate limiting, Adaptive Protection, OpenTelemetry instrumentation, and continuous attack surface monitoring via IONIX and Stream Security.</li>
          <li>Advanced MLOps frameworks using MLflow and FastAPI, and led GitHub-to-Bitbucket migration, improving engineering productivity by 30%.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="role-card reveal">
      <summary>
        <span><span class="role-title">Senior Software Engineer – DevOps</span> <span class="role-company">— Tech Mahindra, Mumbai</span></span>
        <span class="role-dates">Jul 2022 – Sep 2024 <span class="chevron">▸</span></span>
      </summary>
      <div class="role-body">
        <ul>
          <li>Drove enterprise-scale CI/CD platform engineering using Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, and Ansible, improving release efficiency and deployment reliability.</li>
          <li>Delivered Infrastructure as Code across GCP, AWS, and Azure using Terraform and Ansible, streamlining provisioning, configuration management, backup automation, and disaster recovery.</li>
          <li>Administered highly available Kubernetes platforms with Docker and Helm, maintaining 99.9% service availability through proactive monitoring.</li>
          <li>Strengthened platform security via DevSecOps controls, enterprise backup/DR, observability frameworks, and secure artifact management.</li>
          <li>Managed enterprise backup and disaster recovery using Veeam and Kasten K10, ensuring business continuity across cloud-native environments.</li>
          <li>Administered artifact lifecycle management through JFrog Artifactory; executed OS patch management and secrets management practices.</li>
          <li>Partnered with Google Cloud, Microsoft, and AWS engineering teams to optimize platform performance and accelerate cloud transformation.</li>
        </ul>
