          <li>Facilitated GCP infrastructure provisioning, cloud migration, and reliability initiatives through Terraform automation, observability, and IAM governance.</li>
          <li>Managed end-to-end monitoring and alerting, proactively identifying anomalies and maintaining high service availability.</li>
          <li>Led incident response and resolution, coordinating cross-functional teams to minimize downtime and maintain SLA compliance.</li>
